  "2": {
   "segId": "Chullin.27b.3",
   "sugya": "chullin_27a_tanna_meitei_lah_mehacha",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "schema",
     "object": "hk_of_beshechita",
     "kind": "hekesh",
     "status": "stands",
     "gloss_en": "זאת תורת הבהמה והעוף -- מה בהמה בשחיטה אף עוף בשחיטה"
    },
    {
     "type": "schema",
     "object": "hk_of_berov_shnayim",
     "kind": "hekesh",
     "status": "blocked",
     "gloss_en": "אי מה להלן ברוב שנים אף כאן ברוב שנים? -- the proposed extension: a bird too by the majority of two simanim"
    },
    {
     "type": "defeater_verse",
     "object": "miut_zot_rov_shnayim",
     "gloss_en": "תלמוד לומר זאת -- 'this' restricts the juxtaposition",
     "verse": "ויקרא יא,מו",
     "blocks": "hk_of_berov_shnayim",
     "withdrawn": false,
     "answered": false
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_tk_of_beshechita",
     "gloss_en": "the first tanna: as an animal is by slaughter, so a bird is by slaughter -- from 'this is the law of the animal and of the bird' (Lev 11:46)"
    }
   ]
  },
  "3": {
   "segId": "Chullin.27b.4",
   "sugya": "chullin_27a_tanna_meitei_lah_mehacha",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "schema",
     "object": "hk_behema_min_hatzavar",
     "kind": "hekesh",
     "status": "stands",
     "gloss_en": "מה עוף הכשרו מן הצואר אף בהמה הכשרה מן הצואר"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_re_tzavar",
     "gloss_en": "R' Eliezer: as a bird's fitness is from the neck, so an animal's fitness is from the neck"
    }
   ]
  },
  "4": {
   "segId": "Chullin.27b.5",
   "sugya": "chullin_27a_tanna_meitei_lah_mehacha",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "schema",
     "object": "hk_behema_mimul_oref",
     "kind": "hekesh",
     "status": "blocked",
     "gloss_en": "אי מה להלן ממול עורף אף כאן ממול עורף? -- the proposed extension: an animal too from the nape"
    },
    {
     "type": "defeater_verse",
     "object": "miut_rosho",
     "gloss_en": "ומלק את ראשו ממול ערפו ולא יבדיל -- ראשו של זה ממול עורף ואין ראשו של אחר ממול עורף",
     "verse": "ויקרא ה,ח",
     "blocks": "hk_behema_mimul_oref",
     "withdrawn": false,
     "answered": false
    }
   ]
  },
  "5": {
   "segId": "Chullin.27b.6",
   "sugya": "chullin_27a_tanna_meitei_lah_mehacha",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "schema",
     "object": "hk_behema_siman_echad",
     "kind": "hekesh",
     "status": "stands",
     "gloss_en": "אי לאו זאת הוה אמינא: מה עוף בסימן אחד אף בהמה בסימן אחד"
    },
    {
     "type": "defeater_verse",
     "object": "miut_zot_siman_echad",
     "gloss_en": "כתב רחמנא זאת -- for R' Eliezer, 'this' blocks the one-siman extension to animals",
     "verse": "ויקרא יא,מו",
     "blocks": "hk_behema_siman_echad",
     "withdrawn": false,
     "answered": false
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_re_zot",
     "gloss_en": "according to R' Eliezer, 'this (zot)' teaches that an animal is not [fit] with one siman as a bird is"
    }
   ]
  },
  "6": {
   "segId": "Chullin.27b.7",
   "sugya": "chullin_27a_tanna_meitei_lah_mehacha",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "schema",
     "object": "hk_of_bein_behema_ledagim",
     "kind": "hekesh",
     "status": "stands",
     "gloss_en": "הטיל הכתוב לעוף בין בהמה לדגים: לחייבו בשני סימנין אי אפשר שכבר הוקש לדגים, לפוטרו בלא כלום אי אפשר שכבר הוקש לבהמה -- הא כיצד הכשרו? בסימן אחד"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_bk_of_siman_echad",
     "gloss_en": "Bar Kappara: the verse set the bird between animal and fish; two simanim is impossible (it is juxtaposed to fish), nothing is impossible (it is juxtaposed to the animal): its fitness is with one siman"
    }
   ]
  },
  "8": {
   "segId": "Chullin.27b.9",
   "sugya": "chullin_27a_tanna_meitei_lah_mehacha",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_slav",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "אלא מעתה, גבי שליו דכתיב ויאספו את השליו, הכי נמי דלאו בשחיטה? והא אמרת: לפוטרו בלא כלום אי אפשר, שכבר הוקש לבהמה!",
     "against": "p_dagim_asifa",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "ans_bimkom_shechita",
     "gloss_en": "התם לא כתיבא אסיפה במקום שחיטה דאחריני, הכא כתיבא אסיפה במקום שחיטה דאחריני -- for fish, gathering is written in place of the flocks' and herds' slaughter; for quail it is not",
     "answers": "obj_slav",
     "restores": "p_dagim_asifa"
    }
   ]
  },
  "0": {
   "segId": "Chullin.27b.1",
   "sugya": "chullin_27a_tanna_meitei_lah_mehacha",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_chofe_peder",
     "gloss_en": "how does he do it? he covers the place of slaughter with the fat and brings it up, and that is a deferential manner toward the Most High"
    }
   ]
  },
  "7": {
   "segId": "Chullin.27b.8",
   "sugya": "chullin_27a_tanna_meitei_lah_mehacha",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_dagim_asifa",
     "gloss_en": "fish are not subject to slaughter -- from 'or if all the fish of the sea be gathered for them' (Num 11:22): mere gathering suffices for them"
    }
   ]
  },
